**Usage example** (not required, just shows the wiring):
```tsx
<CheckoutPage
  items={cartItems}
  onBack={() => navigate('/cart')}
  onPay={async (address) => {
    await submitOrder({ items: cartItems, address });
    navigate('/order-confirmation');
  }}
/>
```

The component validates required address fields on submit, shows per-field errors, computes subtotal/shipping/total, disables the Pay button while empty or submitting, and calls `onBack`/`onPay` so you can wire in your router and payment API.
